    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      422.51,
      542.52,
      446.98
    ],
    "text": "Regulations made by the Minister of Health and Mass Media, in consultation with the Food Advisory Committee under Section 32 of the Food Act, No. 26 of 1980.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      454.35,
      540.0,
      500.98
    ],
    "text": "Dr. Nalinda Jayathissa, Minister of Health and Mass Media.Colombo,27th December, 2024.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      509.51,
      542.53,
      533.98
    ],
    "text": "The Food (Labelling and Advertising) Regulations 2022, published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2319/40 of February 14, 2023, as amended by Gazette Extraordinary, No. 2364/24 of 27th December, 2023 is hereby further amended.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      541.51,
      494.61,
      554.98
    ],
    "text": "1. By repealing regulation 1 of the aforementioned regulation, the following regulations are hereby substituted.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      562.51,
      457.92,
      575.98
    ],
    "text": "1 (i) These regulations may be cited as Food (Labelling and Advertising) Regulations 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      97.01,
      583.51,
      542.53,
      607.98
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Regulations 2 to Regulation 13 (15) and Regulation 15 along with I to IX Schedules shall come into operation on 1st July, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      97.01,
      615.51,
      482.18,
      628.98
    ],
    "text": "(iii) Regulations 13 (16), 13 (17), 13 (18) and 14 shall come into operation on 1st January, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      636.51,
      542.54,
      660.98
    ],
    "text": "2. In the provision to regulation 13 (16) of the Sinhalese version thereof, by the substitution for the word \"children\" of the word \"Young children\".",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
